<title>ITALY: June air cargo at Rome airports fell 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>June air cargo at Rome airports fell 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rome airport operator said June air cargo at Fiumicino Leonardo de Vinci and Ciampino airports, fell 2.3 percent to 21,853 tonnes against the same period 1996.</p>
<p>Mail at the Rome airports rose 1.2 percent against the same period 1996.</p>
<p>Cargo and mail handled by the two airports in tonnes with the percentage change was as follows, official figures showed. June 1997</p>
<p>		  Cargo    pct change     Mail	pct change</p>
<p>Fiumicino     20,998   down  3.3	3,274     up  1.2</p>
</text>
